* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* -------------------------------------------------------------------- *
* NOMDLAFL
* Delete archive flags of all active reports which are to be archived
* fhi/SAG, 09/2014,
* -------------------------------------------------------------------- *
*
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING MONIT-GL
LOCAL
1 #YESNO   (A3)
*
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
SET KEY ALL
FORMAT LS=133
*
INPUT (AD=MILT'_')
  '*****************************************************************' /
  '***           Entire Output Management Utility                ***' /
  '***      Delete Archive Flag of all Active Reports which      ***' /
  '***            are marked for archiving (''A'')                 ***'/
  '*****************************************************************' //
  'Please confirm with ''YES''' #YESNO    / '(PF3 - Quit)' //
IF *PF-KEY NE 'ENTR' OR #YESNO NE 'YES'
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
FNDAR. FIND ACTIVE-REPORTS WITH AR-ARCHIVE = 'A'
  RESET AR-ARCHIVE
  UPDATE (FNDAR.)
  END TRANSACTION
END-FIND
*
END
